# Context-ignore for builds whose context is `windows` (Dockerfile.nvidia, built by
# build-buildkit.ps1 with -Context windows so the EULA-gated TensorRT zip stays out of every
# OTHER stage's root context -- see the root .dockerignore).
# The CUDA installer + cuDNN zip are downloaded at build time by Install-Cuda.ps1; if a
# copy sits in downloads/ it must NOT ride into the build context (~3.8 GB) or the
# trt-extract stage layer. Only TensorRT*.zip is consumed from downloads/.
downloads/*.exe
downloads/cudnn-*.zip
